Keep a shared days as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into days.
Place 4 into days.
Place 6 into days.
Place 7 into days.
Place 8 into days.
Place 20 into days.
Keep a shared prices as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 2 into prices.
Place 7 into prices.
Place 15 into prices.
Keep a shared travel as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared table as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every slot from 0 to 30, Place 0 into travel.
For every slot from 0 to 30, Place 0 into table.
For each day in days, set item day of travel to 1.

To fill from date (a whole number).
If item date of travel is 0, set item date of table to item (date minus 1) of table, return.
The week is date minus 7.
If week is less than 0, set week to 0.
The month is date minus 30.
If month is less than 0, set month to 0.
The single is item (date minus 1) of table plus item 0 of prices.
The span is item week of table plus item 1 of prices.
The longspan is item month of table plus item 2 of prices.
The best is the smaller of single and span.
The finest is the smaller of best and longspan.
Set item date of table to finest.

For every date from 1 to 20, fill from date.
Show item 20 of table.
